    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>It's exactly that. It's just exhausting. Like I'm reading a language I used to speak fluently but now it's all just gibberish and noise. I feel so obsolete. Like a piece of old tech that's no longer supported, just taking up space and waiting for the power to run out. Does that even make sense? It just feels like there's no point in trying to catch up anymore.",
